19
00:01:28,633 --> 00:01:31,666
我的外公说
wǒ de wài gōng shuō
My grandpa said

20
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:34,066
嗯
ěn
Um

21
00:01:34,633 --> 00:01:37,700
我不喜欢他
wǒ bù xǐ huan tā
I don't like him

22
00:01:38,033 --> 00:01:42,466
